<p><a href="/2011/08/31/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/">「流行り神１」 全通 更新相关截图和疑问（严重剧透注意 令人不适图注意）</a>最先出现在<a href="/">終ノ空</a>。</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p>最近沉迷了~<br>总的来说这个游戏就是在<span style="color: #ff0000;">逼你走灵异线</span>= =<br>有的地方不走灵异还拿不到S评价，最后总阅读率在92%，Database收集率100%<br>序章没啥好讲的，第零话是半年多前玩的了，已经不大记得，就不写了。= =</p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator"/>



<p>四个番外：<br>分明是水明、人見、ゆうか和蘭子四个人的故事<br>个人觉得水明篇的比较有意思，人見和ゆうか的都比较无聊= =<br>蘭子的退魔编就是用来开坑的了，果然这家伙不是表面上看起来这么颓废（第一话也有提到）<br><br>另外，番外有个共同的特点：这些灵异事件都是真相未明的，就连灵异的解释都没有。<br>“受验者”无一例外地在最后都表示想要知道事情的真相，不过我估计这个真相不会在续作中揭开了<br>&nbsp;<br>截图：番外的就只放下水明老爸的截图和退魔篇的图吧<br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/attachment/2591540110591937504/"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-157 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2591540110591937504.jpg" alt="2591540110591937504" width="480" height="272" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2591540110591937504.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2591540110591937504-300x170.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/attachment/575897802366928432/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-148 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/575897802366928432.jpg" alt="575897802366928432" width="480" height="272" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/575897802366928432.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/575897802366928432-300x170.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/attachment/665688319937626479/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-150 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/665688319937626479.jpg" alt="665688319937626479" width="480" height="272" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/665688319937626479.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/665688319937626479-300x170.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/attachment/1570911845039096610/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-154 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/1570911845039096610.jpg" alt="1570911845039096610" width="480" height="272" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/1570911845039096610.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/1570911845039096610-300x170.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/attachment/3108891117786123077/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-162 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/3108891117786123077.jpg" alt="3108891117786123077" width="480" height="272" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/3108891117786123077.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/3108891117786123077-300x170.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/attachment/575897802366928555/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-149 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/575897802366928555.jpg" alt="575897802366928555" width="480" height="272" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/575897802366928555.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/575897802366928555-300x170.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br>&nbsp;</p>



<span id="more-147"></span>



<hr class="wp-block-separator"/>



<p>&nbsp;<br>最终话：<br>感觉很不给力，基本上没讲什么，有点光开坑不解释的嫌疑。<br>至于那个给男主打电话的老头子出现了，在退魔编里也有解释，他是兰子的师傅。<br>不过，<br>1、这个无名车站是龙脉，也是墓地，兰子和师傅为什么要来破坏设施呢？为了阻止这个已经停止了许久的「恶魔的实验」？<br>2、整篇提到的灵异现象顶多只能算有两个，一个是会动的铁桶（那个名词不记得了），另一个就是鬼魂。铁桶可以用两种方法来解释，那么鬼魂呢？这一篇就是希望打破玩家甚至是人见医生对灵异的绝对否定性吗= =<br>3、开篇的地方提到，男主跟ゆうか一起去了这个车站，但是后来只有男主一个人回来了，并且是无端倒在医院门口，而ゆうか要他们再回到那个地方才被救出来，这是怎么回事？<br>&nbsp;<br>截图：<br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/attachment/2863163463117722336/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-159 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2863163463117722336.jpg" alt="2863163463117722336" width="480" height="1630" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2863163463117722336.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2863163463117722336-88x300.jpg 88w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/attachment/3065543971372680671/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-160 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/3065543971372680671.jpg" alt="3065543971372680671" width="480" height="1630" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/3065543971372680671.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/3065543971372680671-88x300.jpg 88w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/attachment/1275644594469622489/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-151 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/1275644594469622489.jpg" alt="1275644594469622489" width="480" height="1630" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/1275644594469622489.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/1275644594469622489-88x300.jpg 88w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a></p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator"/>



<p>&nbsp;<br>今晚刚通了第二话「鬼」，高潮部分太赞了……<br>这一话没弄明白的地方非常少，可能是因为看得比较投入，剧情也确实安排得好……<br>1、安西线中，最后变成鬼的安西为什么会哭呢？因为是被她妹妹上身了？<br>2、安西对男孩的母亲抱有怎样的怨恨？只是她把孩子带走了所以？抑或是她妹妹的魂寄托在了那个石榴戒指里面？<br>&nbsp;<br>截图送上：<br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/attachment/3101009818438227541/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-161 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/3101009818438227541.jpg" alt="3101009818438227541" width="480" height="1340" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/3101009818438227541.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/3101009818438227541-107x300.jpg 107w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/3101009818438227541-367x1024.jpg 367w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/attachment/2847400864421925805/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-158 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2847400864421925805.jpg" alt="2847400864421925805" width="480" height="1340" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2847400864421925805.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2847400864421925805-107x300.jpg 107w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2847400864421925805-367x1024.jpg 367w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/attachment/1354457587948603334/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-152 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/1354457587948603334.jpg" alt="1354457587948603334" width="480" height="1360" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/1354457587948603334.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/1354457587948603334-106x300.jpg 106w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/1354457587948603334-361x1024.jpg 361w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/attachment/2518638091623877727/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-155 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2518638091623877727.jpg" alt="2518638091623877727" width="480" height="1360" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2518638091623877727.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2518638091623877727-106x300.jpg 106w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2518638091623877727-361x1024.jpg 361w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/attachment/1542482872391321747/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-153 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/1542482872391321747.jpg" alt="1542482872391321747" width="480" height="1360" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/1542482872391321747.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/1542482872391321747-106x300.jpg 106w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/1542482872391321747-361x1024.jpg 361w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/attachment/2518638091623877847/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-156 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2518638091623877847.jpg" alt="2518638091623877847" width="480" height="1360" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2518638091623877847.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2518638091623877847-106x300.jpg 106w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/2518638091623877847-361x1024.jpg 361w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br>完<br>&nbsp;</p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator"/>



<p>第一话完成，设置的悬念比较少<br>第一话有些地方还是觉得没解释清楚，求高人指点一下<br>1、被抽干的血是被狐仙吞了？<br>2、堀川是两年前死去的那女学生美佐的心脏受赠者，但是她到底对此事知道多少？<br>3、两年前的到底是不是事故？是因为美佐心理压力太大导致的事故？<br>4、如果是心理压力，那这个压力应该是神佳给她的吧，为什么要连其他人都杀掉？<br>5、既然灵异线的神佳是被狐仙上身了，那两年前死的美佐跟狐仙到底是什么关系？同一体？还是说没啥关系？<br>&nbsp;<br>第1点，似乎也只能这么解释了吧……人类无法做到这种地步的啊，一滴不剩。<br>第2点，想不明白。美佐跟堀川的关系到底是怎样的<br>第3点，也是感觉故事里没讲清楚。<br>第4点，美佐日记里写的只有神佳对她精神虐待了啊~那为什么要把其他人也杀了。。单纯的报复吗。<br>第5点，我自己想了下，大概是神佳作为一个怀有怨念的人，招致了恶灵上身，但是想杀掉那些学生的应该是事故中死去的那个人吧？<br>&nbsp;<br>下面是一些剧情截图+可能的解释<br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/55846327201108312135242474479507258_004/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-166 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/55846327201108312135242474479507258_004.jpg" alt="55846327201108312135242474479507258_004" width="480" height="272" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/55846327201108312135242474479507258_004.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/55846327201108312135242474479507258_004-300x170.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br>明显只有神山在邀请美佐去玩占卜……<br>&nbsp;<br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/55846327201108312135242474479507258_003/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-165 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/55846327201108312135242474479507258_003.jpg" alt="55846327201108312135242474479507258_003" width="480" height="272" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/55846327201108312135242474479507258_003.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/55846327201108312135242474479507258_003-300x170.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br>这里被附身的神山却又喊出了某男的名字……<br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/55846327201108312135242474479507258_002/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-164 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/55846327201108312135242474479507258_002.jpg" alt="55846327201108312135242474479507258_002" width="480" height="272" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/55846327201108312135242474479507258_002.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/55846327201108312135242474479507258_002-300x170.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br>而堀川又捅了神山，后来神山也消失了，果然堀川是继承了美佐的意志吗？<br>&nbsp;<br><a href="/psp-hayarigami-1-clear-impressions/55846327201108312135242474479507258_000/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-163 size-full" src="http://www.kagami.biz/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/55846327201108312135242474479507258_000.jpg" alt="55846327201108312135242474479507258_000" width="480" height="272" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/55846327201108312135242474479507258_000.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2014/06/55846327201108312135242474479507258_000-300x170.jpg 300w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 480px) 100vw, 480px" /></a><br>这张图有可能说明了堀川是继承了美佐的意志……</p>
